---

<section class="actionInfo">
  <div class="actionInfo__container">
    <div class="actionInfo__container-time infos">
      <h4>活動時間</h4>
      <p>2025年4月29日（二）10:00-12:00</p>
    </div>
    <div class="actionInfo__container-location infos">
      <h4>集合地點</h4>
      <p>茄萣濕地遊客中心（高雄市茄萣區正順北路180號）</p>
    </div>
    <div class="actionInfo__container-trans infos">
      <h4>交通方式</h4>
      <h5>搭乘高鐵</h5>
      <div class="actionInfo__container-trans-method">
        <div class="method__item1">
          <h3 class="method__item1-title1">高鐵</h3>
          <p class="method__item1-content1">台南站</p>
        </div>
        <div class="method__item2">
          <p class="method__item2-title2">轉乘計程車</p>
          <p class="method__item2-content2">約30分鐘</p>
        </div>
        <div class="method__item3">
          <p class="method__item3-title3">茄萣濕地遊客中心</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="actionInfo__container-drive infos">
      <h5>自行開車</h5>
      <p>可停放茄萣濕地遊客中心旁停車場</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @import '../style/_variable.scss';
  .actionInfo {
    width: 100%;
    background: $whiteColor;
    padding-top: 64px;
    padding-bottom: 154px;
    &__container {
      .infos {
        h4 {
          font-size: 25px;
          font-weight: 700;
          color: $fontColor;
          margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        p {
          font-size: 20px;
          color: $fontColor;
        }
        h5 {
          font-size: 20px;
          color: $fontColor;
          font-weight: 700;
          margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
      }
      &-time {
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }
      &-location {
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }
      &-trans {
        margin-bottom: 28px;
        &-method {
          display: flex;

          .method__item1 {
            padding: 40px 50px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            background: $fontColor;
            border-top-left-radius: 20px;
            &-title1 {
              font-size: 16px;
              margin-bottom: 12px;
              color: $whiteColor;
            }
            &-content1 {
              font-size: 20px;
              color: $whiteColor !important;
            }
          }
          .method__item2 {
            padding: 40px 80px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
            align-items: center;
            &::before {
              position: absolute;
              content: '';
              top: 50%;
              left: 50%;
              height: 1px;
              width: 100%;
              transform: translateX(-50%);
              background-color: $fontColor;
            }
            &-title2 {
              font-size: 20px;
              margin-bottom: 4px;
            }
            &-content2 {
              font-size: 20px;
              margin-top: 4px;
            }
          }
          .method__item3 {
            padding: 40px 30px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border: 1px solid $fontColor;
            border-top-left-radius: 20px;
            &-title3 {
              font-size: 20px;
            }
          }
        }
      }
      &-drive {
      }
    }
  }
</style>
